{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And filled with silver.</b> Silver before gold because of its abundance." "The he of <b>ketzeh</b> is added as in <b>laylah</b> (night); therefore the word is milra." "Now above he mentioned that he is wise, and in this verse that he is rich and mighty, as Jeremiah mentions them (Jeremiah 9:22)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:33.226658598Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}